@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+/* bw-port (libntr-ios-reset.patch): Apple builds put the writable data of libntr's C (the SDK libraries, sim7 and
+ * sim_vars.c: the DS's own state) in two sections of their own, __DATA,__machdata and the zero-fill __DATA,__machbss.
+ * The port's in-process restart (port/src/machine.c) copies them at the start and puts them back at a reset.
+ * libsim's other files include sim_host_section.h after this one: they are the host's. -fno-common goes with it. */
